step("Verify: TV1: scalar 3d262fdd... × u 06fce640... → ce3e4ff9...")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
expect(x448_scalar_mult(SCALAR_TV1, U_TV1)).to_equal(EXPECTED_TV1)
```

</details>

